OL,3,AEritrean troops move deep into
OL,4,AEthiopia's Tigray region, residents
OL,5,Atell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FEritrean soldiers have crossed into
OL,8,Fnorthern Ethiopia heading towards an
OL,9,Farea where clashes have been taking
OL,10,Fplace between national army troops and
OL,11,Fregional forces, residents in the
OL,12,FTigrayan town of Adigrat have told the
OL,13,FBBC.
OL,15,FFighting in the region broke out two
OL,16,Fweeks ago after months of tension
OL,17,Fbetween the government and the party
OL,18,Fthat controls Tigray, the Tigray
OL,19,FPeople's Liberation Front (TPLF). Both
OL,20,Fblame one another for violating a 2022
OL,21,Fdeal that ended a two-year civil war.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
