OL,3,AEritrean troops move deep into
OL,4,AEthiopia's Tigray region, residents
OL,5,Atell BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FEthiopia has also accused Eritrea of
OL,8,Fbacking the TPLF - something Asmara has
OL,9,Fpreviously denied.
OL,11,FThe latest unrest follows the launch in
OL,12,FSeptember of new alliance of armed
OL,13,Fgroups in Ethiopia, which includes the
OL,14,FTPLF.
